   <bpmn:task id="Bridge_3_7d73" name="Based on the analysis of both processes, here's the transition sentence:&#10;&#10;**Transition:** &quot;When clients receive the monthly $35 invoices from the Accounts Receivable Department, they may submit reimbursement requests to recover these costs, initiating the ERICS reimbursement process.&quot;&#10;&#10;This transition logically connects Process A to Process B by showing that the invoice generation activity in Process A directly triggers the reimbursement request that starts Process B, creating a seamless flow from vendor payment and client invoicing to customer reimbursement processing." /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_P2B_3" sourceRef="atom_2_sid-B04A55A4-51B9-4576-9C84-2DD04CCD767C" targetRef="Bridge_3_7d73" /><bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_B2C_3" sourceRef="Bridge_3_7d73" targetRef="atom_3_sid-6F22AD7F-6D68-4206-9609-9C64EDEB1088" /><bpmn:extensionElements />
